{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>זבח</b> — burnt offerings and the rest of the sacrifices. And <b>וזבחת עליו את עולותיך</b> and so forth (Exodus 20:21), meaning sacrifices that the wicked bring continually, HaShem abhors; and also, because they bring them for the purpose of harlotry, He abhors them even more."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:04.857560326Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}